{"id":5136,"date":"2023-04-23T16:27:57","date_gmt":"2023-04-23T15:27:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=5136"},"modified":"2023-04-23T16:52:02","modified_gmt":"2023-04-23T15:52:02","slug":"connecter-son-smartphone-android-a-windows11","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2023\/04\/23\/connecter-son-smartphone-android-a-windows11\/","title":{"rendered":"Connecter son smartphone Android \u00e0 Windows11"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:14px\">Parfois il peut \u00eatre tr\u00e8s pratique de connecter son smartphone Android \u00e0 windows et l\u2019utiliser dans une fen\u00eatre comme une autre applications windows. C\u2019est aussi une solution pour enregistrer un tutoriel ou pr\u00e9senter une application sur un projecteur.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5138\" width=\"625\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-1.png 1249w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-1-300x179.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-1-1024x611.png 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-1-768x458.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Voici les \u00e9tapes \u00e0 effectuer pour r\u00e9aliser cette connexion&nbsp;:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">1 sur le smartphone, depuis le \u00ab&nbsp;play store&nbsp;\u00bb d\u2019applications, recherchez \u00ab&nbsp;lien avec windows&nbsp;\u00bb et installer l\u2019application.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-2.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5139\" width=\"74\" height=\"105\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2 Double cliquez sur le bouton Lien avec Windows et activez la connexion&nbsp;:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-3.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5140\" width=\"209\" height=\"248\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-3.png 418w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-3-253x300.png 253w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 209px) 100vw, 209px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2 Sur votre PC, allez dans les param\u00e8tres, puis sous bluetooth et appareils, choisissez \u00ab&nbsp;Mobile connect\u00e9s&nbsp;\u00bb et appuyez sur le bouton \u00ab&nbsp;ouvrir Mobile Connect\u00e9s&nbsp;\u00bb<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-4.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5141\" width=\"531\" height=\"377\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-4.png 1061w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-4-300x213.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-4-1024x727.png 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-4-768x545.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 531px) 100vw, 531px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La fen\u00eatre principale va s\u2019ouvrir&nbsp;:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-5.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5142\" width=\"639\" height=\"267\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-5.png 1277w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-5-300x125.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-5-1024x428.png 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/word-image-5136-5-768x321.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 639px) 100vw, 639px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Zone 1&nbsp;: vous avez les informations syst\u00e8me du smartphone, en double cliquant sur le symbole rectangulaire, votre t\u00e9l\u00e9phone apparaitra dans une fen\u00eatre.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Zone&nbsp;2 : vous pouvez voir les derniers messages re\u00e7us.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Zone 3&nbsp;: vous pouvez visualiser toutes les photos du t\u00e9l\u00e9phone<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Zone 4\u00a0: vous pouvez voir toutes les applications contenues dans le smartphone. En double cliquant dessus, vous pouvez les lancer.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Remarque : Il semblerait que les smartphone de marque Samsung ont un peu peu plus d&rsquo;options disponibles que les autres marques de smartphone.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Parfois il peut \u00eatre tr\u00e8s pratique de connecter son smartphone Android \u00e0 windows et l\u2019utiliser dans une fen\u00eatre comme une<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":5150,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[264],"tags":[37],"class_list":["post-5136","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-articles","tag-windows"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5136","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/4"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5136"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5136\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5159,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5136\/revisions\/5159"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5150"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5136"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5136"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5136"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}